  "category": "games",
  "description": "A tank duel across a hillside that changes with every explosion. Set your angle and power, allow for the wind, and try to land a shot before the other tank gets you. Drag to aim and tap FIRE, or adjust with the buttons and hold Select to fire. Take your time: there is no aiming timer.\n\nSave and exit to continue later.\n\nFor Pebble Time 2 and Round 2. Touch requires firmware 4.33.2 or later; buttons remain available. By Luke Steuber.",
  "releaseNotes": "Round results now explain the outcome and show totals. Replay takes one deliberate press or tap; unfinished games still ask before restarting.",
